    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882470/extras/2de963d8860c341ba3233784d3f94390.avif?t=1749077306\" width=355 height=90 /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >'Who wouldn't want to punch someone who pisses them off?'</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Martial Arts x Psycho-Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just a few toes into the future</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born with monstrous physical abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yahiro Ako.\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She enters the world of underground fighting through a certain opportunity: ......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From there, the wheels of her life begin to turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it destruction or glory that lies beyond the release of violence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882470/extras/a0b51ec8ee3de4044b015f922388ee05.avif?t=1749077306\" width=355 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ako Yahiro ,OneFistOneKill </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882470/extras/e739b0929e2620ffd8104b6d533bfa84.avif?t=1749077306\" width=748 height=896 /></span>Undefeated in 25 underground fights and undefeated in amateur boxing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hard puncher with tremendous physical strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has overwhelming power, but is unstable for her age. ............</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Makoto Jinnai, the Superhuman</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882470/extras/52d05a9b846df8bef6030d24e58c67e9.avif?t=1749077306\" data-has-big width=800 height=1638 /></span>Undefeated in 12 professional MMA fights and undefeated in professional kickboxing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overwhelming achievements and phenomenal performance overseas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A superhuman fighter who has attracted the attention of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, he actually has a difficult personality. ............</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ryuga Oryuu ,BadBoy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882470/extras/981efeb007e84f97bb667e0ed849f540.avif?t=1749077306\" width=748 height=896 /></span>Three MMA pro wins and a new star athlete for the upstart organization GOUKEN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is a lightweight, but with his speed, combinations, and jiu-jitsu techniques</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is the same age as Ako.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a novel game about girls with a martial arts theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You advance the story by making choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty level is quite low, and the game progresses quickly with an emphasis on the story experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be at least two endings.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882470/extras/2de963d8860c341ba3233784d3f94390.avif?t=1749077306\" width=355 height=90 /></span>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >'Who wouldn't want to punch someone who pisses them off?'</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Martial Arts x Psycho-Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just a few toes into the future</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Born with monstrous physical abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yahiro Ako.\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She enters the world of underground fighting through a certain opportunity: ......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From there, the wheels of her life begin to turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it destruction or glory that lies beyond the release of violence?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882470/extras/a0b51ec8ee3de4044b015f922388ee05.avif?t=1749077306\" width=355 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ako Yahiro ,OneFistOneKill </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882470/extras/e739b0929e2620ffd8104b6d533bfa84.avif?t=1749077306\" width=748 height=896 /></span>Undefeated in 25 underground fights and undefeated in amateur boxing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hard puncher with tremendous physical strength.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has overwhelming power, but is unstable for her age. ............</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Makoto Jinnai, the Superhuman</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882470/extras/52d05a9b846df8bef6030d24e58c67e9.avif?t=1749077306\" data-has-big width=800 height=1638 /></span>Undefeated in 12 professional MMA fights and undefeated in professional kickboxing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overwhelming achievements and phenomenal performance overseas</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A superhuman fighter who has attracted the attention of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, he actually has a difficult personality. ............</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ryuga Oryuu ,BadBoy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882470/extras/981efeb007e84f97bb667e0ed849f540.avif?t=1749077306\" width=748 height=896 /></span>Three MMA pro wins and a new star athlete for the upstart organization GOUKEN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is a lightweight, but with his speed, combinations, and jiu-jitsu techniques</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is the same age as Ako.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a novel game about girls with a martial arts theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You advance the story by making choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty level is quite low, and the game progresses quickly with an emphasis on the story experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be at least two endings.</p>",
